msgid "For example: <i>New York, USA; Sydney, Australia</i>"
msgstr "उदाहरण: <i>New York, USA; Sydney, Australia</i>"

#: books/edit/edition.html
msgid "What is the copyright date?"
msgstr "कॉपीराइट की तारीख क्या है?"

#: books/edit/edition.html
msgid "The year following the copyright statement."
msgstr "कॉपीराइट कथन के बाद का वर्ष।"

#: books/edit/edition.html
msgid "Edition Name (if applicable):"
msgstr "संस्करण का नाम (यदि लागू हो):"

#: books/edit/edition.html
msgid "For example: <i>Centennial edition</i>; <i>First edition</i>"
msgstr "उदाहरण: <i>शताब्दी संस्करण</i>; <i>प्रथम संस्करण</i>"

#: books/edit/edition.html
msgid "Series Name (if applicable)"
msgstr "श्रृंखला का नाम (यदि लागू हो)"

#: books/edit/edition.html
msgid "The name of the publisher's series."
msgstr "प्रकाशक की श्रृंखला का नाम।"

#: books/edit/edition.html
msgid "For example: <i>The Story of Civilization, Part III</i>"
msgstr "उदाहरण: <i>The Story of Civilization, Part III</i>"

#: books/edit/edition.html openlibrary/plugins/openlibrary/contribute.py type/edition/view.html type/work/view.html
